    <string name="about_text">GP Mix for Android %1$s (%2$s edition)\nA digital mixer for streamers and musicians: strips, groups, aux sends, 18 effects, sample pads, player and recorder.\n\n© 2025–2026 GP Audio. All rights reserved.</string>
    <string name="android_limits_text">GP Mix on Android works inside the app. Android does not allow a few things the desktop version does:\n\n• No VST/AU plug-ins: the 18 built-in effects are used instead.\n• No virtual audio cable or Output Router to other apps. Your mix goes to the selected output (speaker, headphones, USB or Bluetooth).\n• Captured app audio (Android 10+) is still played by that app on the device, and it cannot be muted from here.\n• Other apps cannot receive the mix as their microphone without special hardware or root.\n• Latency depends on the phone. Use wired headphones or a USB audio interface for the best result.\n• Edition limits are also capped by the engine: at most 64 channels, 8 Aux buses and 8 Groups per scene.</string>
    <string name="donation_text">GP Mix is made independently. If it helps your streams or music, please consider supporting its development. Thank you!</string>
